<title>USA: Ice Ban America approved sale of stock.</title>
<headline>Ice Ban America approved sale of stock.</headline>
<dateline>CARSON CITY, Nev 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ice Ban America Inc said its board of directors approved the sale of 900,000 shares of common stock in an offering made in accordance with an exemption from registration under Rule 504 of Regulation D promulgated pursuant to the Securities Act of 1933, as amended.</p>
<p>The offering price is $1.00 per share and will be sold directly by the company.</p>
